{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Golden set v1. Each case is a real-world UI string with trap tags. References are approved human translations; the quality-regression job compares a provider's output against them, while the always-on structural job (mock provider) asserts validators never regress. Grows to 300 in week 6.",
  "sourceLocale": "en",
